  "Gain D6 **raw ingredients**. If this unit is a **Feastmaster**, gain D3+3 **raw ingredients** instead.": "",
  "Heal (D6) each friendly **^^Gollop^^** unit that is wholly within 12\" of and visible to a friendly **Feastmaster**.": "",
  "If there is no friendly **Feastmaster** on the battlefield, pick a friendly **^^Gollop Hero^^** to be the **Feastmaster** for the rest of the battle.": "",
  "For the rest of the phase, add 4 to run rolls for friendly **^^Gollop^^** units while they are wholly within 12\" of and visible to a friendly **Feastmaster**.": "",
  "For the rest of the phase, add 3 to charge rolls for friendly **^^Gollop^^** units while they are wholly within 12\" of and visible to a friendly **Feastmaster**.": "",
  "For the rest of the phase, while they are wholly within 12\" of a friendly **Feastmaster**, melee weapons used by friendly **^^Gollop^^** units have **Crit (Mortal)**.": "",
  "For the rest of the phase, add 1 to the number of dice rolled, to a maximum of 3, when making casting rolls and unbinding rolls for friendly **^^Gollop^^** units while they are wholly within 12\" of and visible to a friendly **Feastmaster**.": "",
  "Each friendly **^^Gollop^^** unit that is wholly within 12\" of and visible to a friendly **Feastmaster** can immediately use a **^^Charge^^** ability as if it were your charge phase, but subtract 1 from the number of dice rolled when making the charge roll for that unit.": "",
  "Each time an enemy unit is destroyed, you gain a number of **raw ingredients**.\r\n\r\nThe number of **raw ingredients** yielded by a destroyed unit is the Health characteristic of that unit multiplied by the number of starting models in that unit.\r\n\r\n***Designer's Note**: If a destroyed enemy unit had a Health characteristic of 2 and its starting size was 10 models, it would yield 20 raw ingredients when it was destroyed.*": ""
